{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Halcyon Camera 把菲林的靈魂帶到 iPhone，讓你在按下快門前已看到最終色調，拍出帶有真實菲林味道的相片與影片，適合喜歡復古質感、同時想保留完整手動控制權的攝影愛好者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>十二款手工調校菲林風格</h2>\n<p>內建十二款手工調校的菲林風格，涵蓋 Kodak Portra 400、Cinestill 800T、Velvia 50 及 Tri-X 400，各自重現真實菲林的色溫、色調曲線、顆粒與光暈。拍攝前即可即時預覽，所見即所得。另支援全手動 ISO、快門、對焦、白平衡與曝光控制，並可錄製 4K 影片，所有效果直接寫入成品相片。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-28-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-29-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1260x2736bb-30-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Halcyon Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T08:09:37.838492+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}